      573.41
    ],
    "text": "WS/70. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
