      574.87,
      282.12,
      695.36
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired: Preliminary Plan No. : YA/JFF/2017/114-PPYA 2947 Village : Vannarpannai West G. N. Division : J/88, New Moor Street D. S. Division : Jaffna District : Jaffna Province : Northern Province Purpose : To construct the Sewerage Pumping Station 25",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
