      304.56,
      446.96,
      539.9,
      588.08
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Jaffna on the 14th day of February, 2020 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th day of January, 2020 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
